# SEO

- Use semantic HTML and proper heading hierarchy.
- Use dynamic metadata for important pages.
- Support title, description, Open Graph and canonical URLs where appropriate.
- Blog posts must have SEO-friendly slugs and metadata.
- Implement sitemap and robots.txt.
- Use meaningful image alt text.
- Add structured data only where it is valid and useful.
- Do not keyword-stuff content.
- Do not invent SEO claims or business facts.
